{"n":91,"name":"Ash-Shams","nameAr":"الشمس","meaning":"The Sun","ayahs":15,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلشَّمْسِ وَضُحَىٰهَا","en":"By the sun and its brightness","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلشَّمْسِ","tr":"wal-shamsi","en":"By the sun","root":"شمس","lem":"شَمْس"},{"ar":"وَضُحَىٰهَا","tr":"waḍuḥāhā","en":"and its brightness","root":"ضحو","lem":"ضُحًى"}]},{"n":2,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلْقَمَرِ إِذَا تَلَىٰهَا","en":"And [by] the moon when it follows it","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلْقَمَرِ","tr":"wal-qamari","en":"And the moon","root":"قمر","lem":"قَمَر"},{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"when"},{"ar":"تَلَىٰهَا","tr":"talāhā","en":"it follows it","root":"تلو","lem":"تَلَى"}]},{"n":3,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ إِذَا جَلَّىٰهَا","en":"And [by] the day when it displays it","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ","tr":"wal-nahāri","en":"And the day","root":"نهر","lem":"نَهار"},{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"when"},{"ar":"جَلَّىٰهَا","tr":"jallāhā","en":"it displays it","root":"جلو","lem":"جَلَّى"}]},{"n":4,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلَّيْلِ إِذَا يَغْشَىٰهَا","en":"And [by] the night when it covers [i.e., conceals] it","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلَّيْلِ","tr":"wa-al-layli","en":"And the night","root":"ليل","lem":"لَيْل"},{"ar":"إِذَا","tr":"idhā","en":"when"},{"ar":"يَغْشَىٰهَا","tr":"yaghshāhā","en":"it covers it","root":"غشو","lem":"غَشِيَ"}]},{"n":5,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَمَا بَنَىٰهَا","en":"And [by] the sky and He who constructed it","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","tr":"wal-samāi","en":"And the heaven","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and (He) Who"},{"ar":"بَنَىٰهَا","tr":"banāhā","en":"constructed it","root":"بني","lem":"بَنَى"}]},{"n":6,"juz":30,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا طَحَىٰهَا","en":"And [by] the earth and He who spread it","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","tr":"wal-arḍi","en":"And the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and by (He) Who"},{"ar":"طَحَىٰهَا","tr":"ṭaḥāhā","en":"spread it","root":"طحو","lem":"طَحَى"}]},{"n":7,"juz":30,"ar":"وَنَفْسٍ وَمَا سَوَّىٰهَا","en":"And [by] the soul and He who proportioned it","w":[{"ar":"وَنَفْسٍۢ","tr":"wanafsin","en":"And (the) soul","root":"نفس","lem":"نَفْس"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and (He) Who"},{"ar":"سَوَّىٰهَا","tr":"sawwāhā","en":"proportioned it","root":"سوي","lem":"سَوَّى"}]},{"n":8,"juz":30,"ar":"فَأَلْهَمَهَا فُجُورَهَا وَتَقْوَىٰهَا","en":"And inspired it [with discernment of] its wickedness and its righteousness,","w":[{"ar":"فَأَلْهَمَهَا","tr":"fa-alhamahā","en":"And He inspired it","root":"لهم","lem":"أَلْهَمَ"},{"ar":"فُجُورَهَا","tr":"fujūrahā","en":"(to distinguish) its wickedness","root":"فجر","lem":"فُجُور"},{"ar":"وَتَقْوَىٰهَا","tr":"wataqwāhā","en":"and its righteousness","root":"وقي","lem":"تَقْوَى"}]},{"n":9,"juz":30,"ar":"قَدْ أَفْلَحَ مَن زَكَّىٰهَا","en":"He has succeeded who purifies it,","w":[{"ar":"قَدْ","tr":"qad","en":"Indeed"},{"ar":"أَفْلَحَ","tr":"aflaḥa","en":"he succeeds","root":"فلح","lem":"أَفْلَحَ"},{"ar":"مَن","tr":"man","en":"who"},{"ar":"زَكَّىٰهَا","tr":"zakkāhā","en":"purifies it","root":"زكو","lem":"زَكَّى"}]},{"n":10,"juz":30,"ar":"وَقَدْ خَابَ مَن دَسَّىٰهَا","en":"And he has failed who instills it [with corruption].","w":[{"ar":"وَقَدْ","tr":"waqad","en":"And indeed"},{"ar":"خَابَ","tr":"khāba","en":"he fails","root":"خيب","lem":"خابَ"},{"ar":"مَن","tr":"man","en":"who"},{"ar":"دَسَّىٰهَا","tr":"dassāhā","en":"buries it","root":"دسو","lem":"دَسَّى"}]},{"n":11,"juz":30,"ar":"كَذَّبَتْ ثَمُودُ بِطَغْوَىٰهَآ","en":"Thamūd denied [their prophet] by reason of their transgression,","w":[{"ar":"كَذَّبَتْ","tr":"kadhabat","en":"Denied","root":"كذب","lem":"كَذَّبَ"},{"ar":"ثَمُودُ","tr":"thamūdu","en":"Thamud"},{"ar":"بِطَغْوَىٰهَآ","tr":"biṭaghwāhā","en":"by their transgression","root":"طغي","lem":"طَغْوَى"}]},{"n":12,"juz":30,"ar":"إِذِ ٱنۢبَعَثَ أَشْقَىٰهَا","en":"When the most wretched of them was sent forth.","w":[{"ar":"إِذِ","tr":"idhi","en":"When"},{"ar":"ٱنۢبَعَثَ","tr":"inbaʿatha","en":"(was) sent forth","root":"بعث","lem":"انۢبَعَثَ"},{"ar":"أَشْقَىٰهَا","tr":"ashqāhā","en":"(the) most wicked of them","root":"شقو","lem":"أَشْقَى"}]},{"n":13,"juz":30,"ar":"فَقَالَ لَهُمْ رَسُولُ ٱللَّهِ نَاقَةَ ٱللَّهِ وَسُقْيَـٰهَا","en":"And the messenger of Allāh [i.e., Ṣāliḥ] said to them, \"[Do not harm] the she-camel of Allāh or [prevent her from] her drink.\"","w":[{"ar":"فَقَالَ","tr":"faqāla","en":"But said","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"لَهُمْ","tr":"lahum","en":"to them"},{"ar":"رَسُولُ","tr":"rasūlu","en":"(the) Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"نَاقَةَ","tr":"nāqata","en":"(It is the) she-camel","root":"نوق","lem":"ناقَة"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَسُقْيَـٰهَا","tr":"wasuq'yāhā","en":"and her drink","root":"سقي","lem":"سُقْيا"}]},{"n":14,"juz":30,"ar":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَعَقَرُوهَا فَدَمْدَمَ عَلَيْهِمْ رَبُّهُم بِذَنۢبِهِمْ فَسَوَّىٰهَا","en":"But they denied him and hamstrung her. So their Lord brought down upon them destruction for their sin and made it equal [upon all of them].","w":[{"ar":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ","tr":"fakadhabūhu","en":"But they denied him","root":"كذب","lem":"كَذَّبَ"},{"ar":"فَعَقَرُوهَا","tr":"faʿaqarūhā","en":"and they hamstrung her","root":"عقر","lem":"عَقَرَ"},{"ar":"فَدَمْدَمَ","tr":"fadamdama","en":"So destroyed","root":"دمدم","lem":"دَمْدَمَ"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","tr":"ʿalayhim","en":"them"},{"ar":"رَبُّهُم","tr":"rabbuhum","en":"their Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"بِذَنۢبِهِمْ","tr":"bidhanbihim","en":"for their sin","root":"ذنب","lem":"ذَنب"},{"ar":"فَسَوَّىٰهَا","tr":"fasawwāhā","en":"and leveled them","root":"سوي","lem":"سَوَّى"}]},{"n":15,"juz":30,"ar":"وَلَا يَخَافُ عُقْبَـٰهَا","en":"And He does not fear the consequence thereof.","w":[{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"يَخَافُ","tr":"yakhāfu","en":"He fears","root":"خوف","lem":"خافَ"},{"ar":"عُقْبَـٰهَا","tr":"ʿuq'bāhā","en":"its consequences","root":"عقب","lem":"عُقْبَى"}]}]}